loopcam (1.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Audio tab: added a RhythmRoute toggle so you can set up a plain
    Virtual Mic without requiring Rhythmbox to be running.
  * Added in-app guidance for routing OBS sources (mic/media) into the
    virtual mic only, so audio no longer leaks to your own speakers
    when using the headphone/monitor icon.
  * Reworded audio mode labels to be source-agnostic instead of
    Rhythmbox-specific.

 -- Uzair Mughal <contact@uzair.is-a.dev>  Fri, 18 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000

loopcam (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of LoopCam.
  * Virtual webcam creation via v4l2loopback and pkexec.
  * IP camera and local file looping via ffmpeg.
  * Integrated RhythmRoute audio management for virtual microphones.
  * a minimalist design.

 -- Uzair Mughal <contact@uzair.is-a.dev>  Sun, 13 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
